                                "sense_id": "5569b413-8aa2-3026-b751-b7fb54e59270",
                                "text": "Light was happiness; and the people of Iran, the land of light, were the favourites of heaven; while those of Turan, the gloomy region beyond the mountains to the north, were its enemies."
                            }
                        ]
